IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ATM-WITHDRAW.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(7).
01 WS-WITHDRAW PIC 9(7).
01 WS-REMAINING PIC 9(7).
01 WS-OUT PIC Z(6)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ACCEPT WS-BALANCE.
    ACCEPT WS-WITHDRAW.

    IF WS-WITHDRAW = 0
        DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
    ELSE
        IF WS-WITHDRAW <= WS-BALANCE
            IF FUNCTION MOD(WS-WITHDRAW, 100) = 0

                COMPUTE WS-REMAINING =
                    WS-BALANCE - WS-WITHDRAW

                MOVE WS-REMAINING TO WS-OUT

                DISPLAY "Remaining Balance: " WS-OUT

            ELSE
                DISPLAY "DENOMINATION ERROR"
            END-IF
        ELSE
            DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT FUNDS"
        END-IF
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
